{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 78,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "78:1",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "About what are they asking one another?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:2",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "About the great news -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:3",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "That over which they are in disagreement.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:4",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "No! They are going to know.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:5",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "Then, no! They are going to know.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:6",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "Have We not made the earth a resting place?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:7",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "And the mountains as stakes?",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:8",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "And We created you in pairs",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:9",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "And made your sleep [a means for] rest",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:10",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "And made the night as clothing",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:11",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "And made the day for livelihood",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:12",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 12,
      "text": "And constructed above you seven strong [heavens]",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:13",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 13,
      "text": "And made [therein] a burning lamp",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:14",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 14,
      "text": "And sent down from the rain clouds pouring water",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:15",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "That We may bring forth thereby grain and vegetation",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:16",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "And gardens of entwined growth.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:17",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "Indeed, the Day of Judgement is an appointed time -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:18",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 18,
      "text": "The Day the Horn is blown and you will come forth in multitudes",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:19",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 19,
      "text": "And the heaven is opened and will become gateways",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:20",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 20,
      "text": "And the mountains are removed and will be [but] a mirage.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:21",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 21,
      "text": "Indeed, Hell has been lying in wait",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:22",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 22,
      "text": "For the transgressors, a place of return,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:23",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 23,
      "text": "In which they will remain for ages [unending].",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:24",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 24,
      "text": "They will not taste therein [any] coolness or drink.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:25",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 25,
      "text": "Except scalding water and [foul] purulence -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:26",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 26,
      "text": "An appropriate recompense.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:27",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 27,
      "text": "Indeed, they were not expecting an account",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:28",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 28,
      "text": "And denied Our verses with [emphatic] denial.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:29",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 29,
      "text": "But all things We have enumerated in writing.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:30",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 30,
      "text": "\"So taste [the penalty], and never will We increase you except in torment.\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:31",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 31,
      "text": "Indeed, for the righteous is attainment -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:32",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 32,
      "text": "Gardens and grapevines",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:33",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 33,
      "text": "And young women [companions] of equal age.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:34",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 34,
      "text": "And a full cup.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:35",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 35,
      "text": "No ill speech will they hear therein or any falsehood -",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:36",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 36,
      "text": "[As] reward from your Lord, [a generous] gift [made due by] account,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:37",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 37,
      "text": "[From] the Lord of the heavens and the earth and whatever is between them, the Most Merciful. They possess not from Him [authority for] speech.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:38",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 38,
      "text": "The Day that the Spirit [i.e., Gabriel] and the angels will stand in rows, they will not speak except for one whom the Most Merciful permits, and he will say what is correct.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:39",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 39,
      "text": "That is the True [i.e., certain] Day; so he who wills may take to his Lord a [way of] return.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "78:40",
      "surahNumber": 78,
      "ayahNumber": 40,
      "text": "Indeed, We have warned you of an impending punishment on the Day when a man will observe what his hands have put forth and the disbeliever will say, \"Oh, I wish that I were dust!\"",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
}
